18:["$","div",null,{"className":"terms-sections","children":[[["$","section","agreement",{"id":"agreement","aria-labelledby":"agreement-title","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"terms-number","children":"01"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"agreement-title","children":"Project delivery & the agreement"}],[["$","p","Vertex Models is the brand used for the design and fabrication services presented on this website. Projects may involve independent specialist production or delivery partners. The legal person or entity supplying the commission, its responsibilities and the applicable commercial terms must be identified in the written quotation or agreement before acceptance.",{"children":"Vertex Models is the brand used for the design and fabrication services presented on this website. Projects may involve independent specialist production or delivery partners. The legal person or entity supplying the commission, its responsibilities and the applicable commercial terms must be identified in the written quotation or agreement before acceptance."}],["$","p","For a commissioned project, “we”, “us” and “our” refer to the supplier identified in that agreement and on the invoice. The supplier’s legal name, address, contact information and required registration details must be provided in the project documents and wherever else required by law. A production partner is not automatically the contracting or invoicing supplier; its involvement does not remove the identified supplier’s duties or mandatory client rights.",{"children":"For a commissioned project, “we”, “us” and “our” refer to the supplier identified in that agreement and on the invoice. The supplier’s legal name, address, contact information and required registration details must be provided in the project documents and wherever else required by law. A production partner is not automatically the contracting or invoicing supplier; its involvement does not remove the identified supplier’s duties or mandatory client rights."}],["$","p","This website invites enquiries; browsing it or sending a message does not place an order. A commission requires a written quotation or project agreement accepted by both parties, with these terms supplied or linked before acceptance. Any agreed advance payment and commencement conditions must also be satisfied before work starts.",{"children":"This website invites enquiries; browsing it or sending a message does not place an order. A commission requires a written quotation or project agreement accepted by both parties, with these terms supplied or linked before acceptance. Any agreed advance payment and commencement conditions must also be satisfied before work starts."}],["$","p","The signed project agreement and approved written variations take priority over these general terms where they conflict, subject always to applicable law. A later website update does not change an existing commission without agreement. Keep a copy of the version accepted with your quotation.",{"children":"The signed project agreement and approved written variations take priority over these general terms where they conflict, subject always to applicable law. A later website update does not change an existing commission without agreement. Keep a copy of the version accepted with your quotation."}]]]}],["$","section","scope",{"id":"scope","aria-labelledby":"scope-title","children":["$L1a","$L1b",["$L1c","$L1d","$L1e"]]}],"$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b"],"$L2c"]}]
